1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,699
BRAMBLE: Case open!

2
00:00:01,699 --> 00:00:05,014
IVY: Oh no! Our cabin lost its number!

3
00:00:05,214 --> 00:00:07,744
OTTO: Easy! It's number two hundred!

4
00:00:08,144 --> 00:00:11,399
OTTO: Ninety-nine, one hundred, two hundred!

5
00:00:11,799 --> 00:00:15,409
IVY: Hmm. That cabin says one hundred and one.

6
00:00:15,809 --> 00:00:18,474
Ninety-nine. One hundred.

7
00:00:18,674 --> 00:00:22,352
Past one hundred, keep counting by ones.

8
00:00:22,752 --> 00:00:25,015
One hundred and one.

9
00:00:25,215 --> 00:00:27,888
Then one hundred and two!

10
00:00:28,688 --> 00:00:31,616
OTTO: Oh! I jumped way too far!

11
00:00:32,016 --> 00:00:35,052
It's B! One hundred and two.

12
00:00:35,452 --> 00:00:36,720
BRAMBLE: Case solved!

13
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:41,078
IVY: Look! A snail is moving in!

14
00:00:41,278 --> 00:00:43,721
OTTO: It brought its own house!

15
00:00:44,121 --> 00:00:49,335
Say it with me. Past one hundred, keep counting by ones.

16
00:00:49,735 --> 00:00:53,817
Next case: a witness who needs better words.

